-- Technique for every exercise, and a reload of the library (2026-11-09).
--
-- Kelly reviewed the drafted technique cards and Chris approved the lot, so
-- all 661 exercises that had no technique text now have one. The 27 that were
-- already written by hand were left exactly as they were - the import only
-- ever filled blanks, and that was checked before it ran rather than hoped
-- for afterwards.
--
-- UPSERT, NOT A RELOAD-BY-DELETE. Deleting and reinserting would be the
-- obvious way to resync a content table, and it is the one thing not to do
-- here: it would momentarily empty a table other rows point at, and this
-- project has already lost two days to a content FK quietly rejecting member
-- data. Nothing is removed. A server row whose id is no longer in data.js is
-- reported at the bottom rather than deleted, because deciding that is Chris's
-- call, not this script's.
--
-- Generated from data.js, not retyped. Re-runnable: running it twice changes
-- nothing the second time.

